msgid "All the best to thee."
msgstr "愿神保佑您……"

#. official: data.3.3.1
#: data/text/dialog_lookup_table.py
msgid "I will see thee later."
msgstr "欢迎下次再来。"

#: data/text/dialog_lookup_table.py
msgid ""
"Good morning.\n"
"Thou hast had a good night's sleep I hope."
msgstr ""
"早上好。\n"
"昨晚休息得好吗？"

#: data/text/dialog_lookup_table.py
msgid "And I would like to have something of thine--a token."
msgstr "还有，请把您的一样东西……送给我作为纪念。"

#. official: map.5.6.1
#: data/text/dialog_lookup_table.py
msgid "I will free thee from thy curse."
msgstr "那就让我来帮你解除诅咒吧。"

#. official: map.5.6.2
#: data/text/dialog_lookup_table.py
msgid "Now, go."
msgstr "好，这就没问题了。路上一定要多加小心啊。"

#. official: map.14.0.0
#: data/text/dialog_lookup_table.py
msgid "Thy bravery must be proven."
msgstr "我必须要试一试你的力量。"

#: data/text/dialog_lookup_table.py
msgid "Thus, I propose a test."
msgstr "所以，我要给你一个试炼。"

#. official: map.14.0.0
#: data/text/dialog_lookup_table.py
msgid "There is a Silver Harp that beckons to the creatures of the Dragonlord."
msgstr "我听说这个世界上的某处，有一个能够吸引魔物们的银之竖琴。"

#. official: map.14.0.0
#: data/text/dialog_lookup_table.py
msgid "Bring this to me and I will reward thee with the Staff of Rain."
msgstr "如果你能把它带来，我就承认你是勇者，把雨云法杖交给你。"

#: data/text/dialog_lookup_table.py
msgid "In thy task thou hast failed. Alas, I fear thou art not the one Erdrick predicted would save us."
msgstr "看来你在试炼中失败了。啊啊，或许你并不是洛特所预言的勇者。"

#: data/text/dialog_lookup_table.py
msgid "Go now!"
msgstr "去吧！"

#: data/text/dialog_lookup_table.py
msgid "Thou may go and search."
msgstr "去找找看吧。"

#: data/text/dialog_lookup_table.py
msgid "Please push RESET, hold it in, then turn off the POWER."
msgstr "请按住RESET键，再关掉电源。"

#: data/text/dialog_lookup_table.py
msgid "If you turn the power off first, the Imperial Scroll of Honor containing your deeds may be lost."
msgstr "如果先关掉电源，冒险之书的记录可能会消失。"

#: data/text/dialog_lookup_table.py
msgid "BUY"
msgstr "买东西"

#: data/text/dialog_lookup_table.py
msgid "SELL"
msgstr "卖东西"

#. official: data.3.1.11
#: data/text/dialog_lookup_table.py
msgid "Thou hast no possessions."
msgstr "诶？您什么也没带啊。"

#. official: data.3.0.12
#: data/text/dialog_lookup_table.py
msgid "I cannot buy it."
msgstr "唔……不好意思，我无法收购那个。"

#: data/text/dialog_lookup_table.py
msgid "I am sorry."
msgstr "非常抱歉。"

#. official: data.3.3.5
#: data/text/dialog_lookup_table.py
msgid "I am sorry, but I cannot sell thee anymore."
msgstr "不好意思，不能卖给你更多了。"

#: data/text/dialog_lookup_table.py
msgid "I suggest making a map if thy path leads into the darkness."
msgstr "如果要进入黑暗的洞窟，最好先画好地图。"

#: data/text/dialog_lookup_table.py
msgid ""
"I'm too busy.\n"
"Ask the other guard."
msgstr ""
"我很忙。\n"
"去问其他士兵吧。"

#. official: map.7.8.0
msgid "The harp attracts enemies. Stay away from the grave in Garinham."
msgstr "据说那竖琴的声音会唤来魔物。还是不要靠近加雷之墓比较好。"

#: data/text/dialog_lookup_table.py
msgid "Many believe that Princess Gwaelin is hidden away in a cave."
msgstr "很多人都相信，萝拉公主被囚禁在某个洞窟里。"

#. official: map.5.14.0
#: data/text/dialog_lookup_table.py
msgid "In legends it is said that fairies know how to put Golem to sleep."
msgstr "据古代文献所说，妖精们能够让巨像兵陷入沉睡。"

#. official: map.8.0.0
#: data/text/dialog_lookup_table.py
msgid "This is the village of Kol."
msgstr "这里是麦拉村。"

#: data/text/dialog_lookup_table.py
msgid "Golem is afraid of the music of the flute, so ʼtis said."
msgstr "据说巨像兵害怕笛子的声音。"

#: data/text/dialog_lookup_table.py
msgid "This bath cures rheumatism."
msgstr "这个温泉对风湿很有效哦。"

#: data/text/dialog_lookup_table.py
msgid "Please,save us from the minions of the Dragonlord."
msgstr "请从龙王的手下们手中救救我们吧。"

#. official: map.5.9.0
#: data/text/dialog_lookup_table.py
msgid ""
"Art thou the descendant of Erdrick?\n"
"Hast thou any proof?"
msgstr ""
"你是洛特血脉的继承者？\n"
"有没有什么证据啊？"

#: data/text/dialog_lookup_table.py
msgid ""
"Hast thou seen Nester?\n"
"I think he may need help."
msgstr ""
"你有没有看到内斯特？\n"
"他可能需要帮助。"

#: data/text/dialog_lookup_table.py
msgid "East of Hauksness there is a town, ʼtis said, where one may purchase weapons of extraordinary quality."
msgstr "据说在多姆多拉的东边，有一个贩卖很优质的武器的城镇。"

#. official: map.9.0.0
#: data/text/dialog_lookup_table.py
msgid "Welcome to Cantlin, the castle town."
msgstr "欢迎来到要塞城市麦尔基德！"

#. official: map.9.4.0
#: data/text/dialog_lookup_table.py
msgid ""
"Come buy my radishes! They are fresh and cheap.\n"
"Buy thy radishes today!"
msgstr ""
"欢迎！今天的萝卜很便宜哦！\n"
"快来买刚采收的萝卜吧！"

#: data/text/dialog_lookup_table.py
msgid "What shall I get for thy dinner?"
msgstr "晚饭要做什么好呢？"

#: data/text/dialog_lookup_table.py
msgid ""
"I'm Nester.\n"
"Hey, where am I? No, don't tell me!"
msgstr ""
"我是内斯特。\n"
"咦，这里是哪里？不，别告诉我！"

#: data/text/dialog_lookup_table.py
msgid "I know nothing."
msgstr "我什么也不知道。"

#: data/text/dialog_lookup_table.py
msgid "To learn how proof may be obtained that thy ancestor was the great Erdrick, see a man in this very town."
msgstr "如果想得到你的祖先是伟大的洛特的证明，就去拜访这个镇上的一个男人吧。"

#. official: map.9.7.0
#: data/text/dialog_lookup_table.py
msgid "Grandfather used to say that his friend, Wynn, had buried something of great value at the foot of a tree behind his shop."
msgstr "以前我爷爷老是会说起一件事。他的朋友幸信先生好像把某样很珍贵的宝物埋藏在了自己店后面的树下。"

#: data/text/dialog_lookup_table.py
msgid "ʼTis said that Erdrick's sword could cleave steel."
msgstr "据说洛特之剑连钢铁都能斩断。"

#: data/text/dialog_lookup_table.py
msgid "My Grandfather Wynn once had a shop on the east side of Hauksness."
msgstr "我的爷爷幸信以前在多姆多拉的东边开店。"

#. official: map.2.5.2
#: data/text/dialog_lookup_table.py
msgid "Dost thou love me, {}?"
msgstr "{}大人……您有没有想念萝拉？"

#. official: map.9.3.1
#: data/text/dialog_lookup_table.py
msgid "Thou art truly brave."
msgstr "啊！你才是真正的勇者！"

#. official: map.9.3.2
#: data/text/dialog_lookup_table.py
msgid ""
"That is good.’\n"
"`No one will say thou art afraid."
msgstr ""
"这样也好。”\n"
"“我想没有人会说你是胆小鬼的。"

#. official: data.3.1.7
#: data/text/dialog_lookup_table.py
msgid "Thou cannot hold more Herbs."
msgstr "不能再拿更多药草了。"

#. official: data.3.1.13
#: data/text/dialog_lookup_table.py
msgid ""
"Thou said the {}.\n"
"I will buy thy {} for {} GOLD.\n"
"Is that all right?"
msgstr ""
"{}吗。\n"
"那件{}的话，我就用{}金币收下吧。\n"
"可以吗？"

#. official: data.3.4.0
#: data/text/dialog_lookup_table.py
msgid "Will thou buy some Fairy Water for {} GOLD to keep the Dragonlord's minions away?"
msgstr "请问要买驱魔的圣水吗？一瓶{}金币。"

#. official: data.3.4.3
#: data/text/dialog_lookup_table.py
msgid "Thou cannot carry anymore."
msgstr "客人您好像拿不下更多东西了。"

#. official: data.3.4.4
#: data/text/dialog_lookup_table.py
msgid ""
"I thank thee.\n"
"Won't thou buy one more bottle?"
msgstr ""
"谢谢惠顾。\n"
"要不要再买1瓶？"

#. official: data.3.3.4
#: data/text/dialog_lookup_table.py
msgid ""
"Here,take this key.\n"
"Dost thou wish to purchase more?"
msgstr ""
"喏，给你一个钥匙。\n"
"还想买钥匙吗？"

#. official: map.2.8.0
#: data/text/dialog_lookup_table.py
msgid ""
"I am glad thou hast returned.\n"
"All our hopes are riding on thee."
msgstr ""
"你回来啦！我非常高兴！\n"
"全世界的人们都把希望寄托在你身上了。"

#. official: data.3.7.11
#: data/text/dialog_lookup_table.py
msgid "See me again when thy level has increased."
msgstr "升级后再来见我吧。"

#. official: map.2.6.0
#: data/text/dialog_lookup_table.py
msgid "Now, Gwaelin, come to my side."
msgstr "好了，萝拉。快到我的身边来。"

#. official: map.5.3.0
#: data/text/dialog_lookup_table.py
msgid "Beware the bridges!"
msgstr "要当心桥梁！"

#. official: map.5.3.0
#: data/text/dialog_lookup_table.py
msgid "Danger grows when thou crosses."
msgstr "过了桥到了越远的地方，就会有越可怕的魔物们来袭击你。"

#: data/text/dialog_lookup_table.py
msgid "Thou shouldst come here again."
msgstr "你可以再来这里。"

#: data/text/dialog_lookup_table.py
msgid "Dreadful is the South Island."
msgstr "南方的岛屿是个可怕的地方。"

#: data/text/dialog_lookup_table.py
msgid "Great strength and skill and wit only will bring thee back from that place."
msgstr "若没有强大的力量、技巧和智慧，是无法从那里活着回来的。"

#. official: map.9.3.0
#: data/text/dialog_lookup_table.py
msgid "ʼTis said that the Dragonlord hath claws that can cleave iron and fiery breath that can melt stone."
msgstr "据说龙王的爪子能抓破铁板，喷出的火炎能把岩石烧化。"

#. official: map.9.2.0
#: data/text/dialog_lookup_table.py
msgid "It is said that many have held Erdrick's armor."
msgstr "根据我得到的消息，洛特之铠多次易主。"

#. official: map.9.2.0
#: data/text/dialog_lookup_table.py
msgid "The last to have it was a fellow named Wynn."
msgstr "最后好像是落在了一个叫幸信的人手里。"

#: data/text/dialog_lookup_table.py
msgid "Let us wish the warrior well!"
msgstr "让我们为勇者的平安祈祷吧！"

#: data/text/dialog_lookup_table.py
msgid "May the light be thy strength!"
msgstr "愿光明成为你的力量！"

#: data/text/dialog_lookup_table.py
msgid "From Tantegel Castle travel 70 leagues to the south and 40 to the east."
msgstr "从拉达托姆城向南走70步，再向东走40步看看吧。"

#. official: map.21.0.0
#: data/text/dialog_lookup_table.py
msgid "I am Gwaelin, daughter of Lorik."
msgstr "我叫萝拉，是拉达托姆国王拉鲁斯十六世的女儿。"

#. official: map.33.0.2
#: data/text/dialog_lookup_table.py
msgid "I give thee now a chance to share this world and to rule half of it if thou will now stand beside me."
msgstr "如果你愿意加入我的话，我就把世界分给你一半。"

#. official: map.2.6.1
#: data/text/dialog_lookup_table.py
msgid ""
"Gwaelin then whispers:\n"
"`Wait a moment,please.\n"
"I would give a present to {}.’"
msgstr ""
"萝拉公主小声说道：\n"
"“请等一下。\n"
"萝拉有东西要送给{}大人。”"

#: data/text/dialog_lookup_table.py
msgid "Please give me thy {}."
msgstr "请把您的{}给我吧。"

#. official: map.2.1.4
#: data/text/dialog_lookup_table.py
msgid "Oh, brave {}."
msgstr "哦哦，{}！多么出色的勇者啊！"

#: data/text/dialog_lookup_table.py
msgid "Thank you for saving the Princess."
msgstr "谢谢您救出了公主。"

#: data/text/dialog_lookup_table.py
msgid ""
"Who touches me?’\n"
"`I see nothing, nor can I hear."
msgstr ""
"是谁在碰我？”\n"
"“我的眼睛看不见，耳朵也听不到。"

#. official: map.2.0.1
#: data/text/dialog_lookup_table.py
msgid ""
"Forever shall I be grateful for the gift of my daughter returned to her home, {}.\n"
"Accept my thanks."
msgstr ""
"{}，真是多亏你把公主给救了回来啊。\n"
"我一生也不会忘记今天这个日子的。我真是衷心感谢你！"

#: data/text/dialog_lookup_table.py
msgid "Please accept my love, {}."
msgstr "{}大人，请接受我的爱。"

#: data/text/dialog_lookup_table.py
msgid "Farewell, {}."
msgstr "请多保重，{}大人。"

#: data/text/dialog_lookup_table.py
msgid "Though thou art as brave as thy ancestor, {}, thou cannot defeat the great Dragonlord with such weapons."
msgstr "{}啊，即使你像你的祖先一样勇敢，用那样的武器也是打不倒龙王的。"

#: data/text/dialog_lookup_table.py
msgid "Thou art brave indeed to rescue me, {}."
msgstr "{}大人，您竟然来救我，真是一位勇敢的人。"

#. official: map.33.0.1
#: data/text/dialog_lookup_table.py
msgid ""
"Welcome, {}.\n"
"I am the Dragonlord--King of Kings."
msgstr ""
"来得好，{}！\n"
"我正是王中之王，龙王！"

#: data/text/dialog_lookup_table.py
msgid ""
"The {}?\n"
"Thank you very much."
msgstr ""
"您说{}吗？\n"
"真是太感谢了。"

#: data/text/dialog_lookup_table.py
msgid ""
"Oh, my dearest Gwaelin!’\n"
"`I hate thee, {}."
msgstr ""
"哦哦，我亲爱的萝拉公主！”\n"
"“我讨厌{}！"

msgid "H: Show Controls"
msgstr "H: 查看操作方法"

msgid "F11: Toggle Fullscreen"
msgstr "F11: 切换全屏"

msgid "1-5: Adjust Game Speed"
msgstr "1-5: 调整游戏速度"

